67
01:01:59,791 --> 01:02:01,666
<b>Te lo prometo, Che.</b>

68
01:02:01,666 --> 01:02:03,416
<b>Nos vemos pronto.</b>

69
01:02:03,416 --> 01:02:04,791
<b>Y recordá, Buenos</b>

70
01:02:04,791 --> 01:02:06,791
<b>Aires ya te ha
elegido.</b>

71
01:02:06,791 --> 01:02:07,750
<b>Ahora solo tenés
que</b>

72
01:02:07,750 --> 01:02:09,416
<b>aceptar la invitación.</b>
